#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:1
msgid "源码版本、factory 代际与依赖维护"
msgstr "Source versions, factory generations and dependency maintenance"

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:3
msgid ""
"Nexus 交付源码 SDK。消费方在同一配置、编译器和 ABI 选择下重新编译 Core、 provider、生成 bindings "
"和调用者；当前不交付稳定二进制 ABI。预编译库、不同 enum 选项、不同 FP ABI 或不同生成 bundle "
"的对象不能因为版本号相同而混合链接。"
msgstr ""
"Nexus delivers a source SDK. Consumers rebuild Core, providers, generated "
"bindings and callers under the same configuration, compiler and ABI choices;"
" no stable binary ABI is currently delivered. Precompiled libraries, "
"different enum options, FP ABIs or generated-bundle objects cannot be mixed "
"merely because versions match."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:7
msgid "版本各自负责什么"
msgstr "What each version owns"

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:9
msgid ""
"`dependencies/platform-compatibility.json` 是源码接口代际的唯一策略数据。 "
"`tools/configure/metadata.py` 是生产装配器和维护工具共用的严格纯 stdlib loader。 "
"它拒绝重复键、未知字段、缺失策略、布尔伪整数、非规范版本和 symlink 输入；不会 迁移 TOML、选择硬件、执行构建或替换任何未知值。"
msgstr ""
"`dependencies/platform-compatibility.json` is the sole source-interface-"
"generation policy data. `tools/configure/metadata.py` is the strict pure-"
"stdlib loader shared by production assembly and maintenance tools. It "
"rejects duplicate keys, unknown fields, missing policy, boolean pseudo-"
"integers, noncanonical versions and symlink inputs. It neither migrates "
"TOML, selects hardware, runs builds nor replaces unknown values."

