#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:201
msgid ""
"工具只形成 proposal。缺证据为 `not_executed`；提供真实 file identities 也只变成 "
"`referenced_unreviewed`。即使引用 JSON 自称 passed，工具也不升级资格，不执行其 命令、不修改 "
"Gitlink/lock、不创建自动升级 commit。现有正式 validators 必须对 升级的 exact clean 源、完整 scope "
"和同一 artifact 独立执行。随后通过正常 staged review、hooks 和 CI 原子更新源码 Gitlink/厂商 "
"import、锁、许可和外部 SDK pin。"
msgstr ""
"The tool produces proposals only. Missing evidence is `not_executed`; real "
"file identities become only `referenced_unreviewed`. Even referenced JSON "
"claiming passed cannot promote qualification, run its commands, modify "
"Gitlinks/locks or create automatic upgrade commits. Existing formal "
"validators independently execute exact upgraded clean sources, full scopes "
"and the same artifacts. Normal staged review, hooks and CI then atomically "
"update source Gitlinks/vendor imports, locks, licensing and external SDK "
"pins."

#: ../../../docs/design/source-compatibility.md:207
msgid ""
"没有实板时，受升级影响的电气、IRQ/DMA timing、低功耗和长期负载仍是物理 pending。 一次 upstream request、一个模型"
" pass 或之前版本的软件候选都不能代替本次验收。"
msgstr ""
"Without boards, affected electrical behavior, IRQ/DMA timing, low power and "
"long-running load remain physically pending. An upstream request, one model "
"pass or a previous version's software candidate cannot replace acceptance "
"for this upgrade."
